 "note": "R125c - PS4 goalie gear selection keys through the vault (package 4). Read-only; reuses the 2026-09-19 vault reader (vlt_collections) and\nthe 2026-09-20 R16 DB loader (ps4_team_field_map) exactly as R16 did (genuine NHL 20 = CUSA15439 install).\nPer title, decoded records of the goalie texture-pack classes -> key tuples:\n  mask   ge_nhl_goaliehelmettexturepack : (GoalieMaskTexture, GoalieHelmetBrand)      vs DB (maskid, masktype)\n  stick  ge_nhl_goaliesticktexturepack  : (GoalieStickBrand, StickHandedness)\n  blocker / trapper texture packs       : (GoalieBrands, StickHandedness)\n  pads   goaliepadtexturepack + goaliemergedpadtexturepack : GoalieBrands (value overlap between the two classes)\n  throat ge_nhl_goaliethroatprotector   : (GoalieHelmetBrand, OnOff)\nReported: per DB row, whether (maskid, masktype) names exactly one mask record, a record under another brand only, or none; per\ncatalogue, brands carrying both handedness values; team mask slot values (exhibitionteams.goaliemask*) in the GoalieMaskTexture set.\nTyped-attribute joins are data joins; which record the runtime draws is not observed.\nUsage: python r125c_ps4_goalie_selection_keys.py <out.json> [titles...]\n",
